    "summary": "Bearer: a **C'TAN SHARD OF THE VOID DRAGON** model.\n\nOnce per turn, as [your opponent's Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase) begins, pick an enemy **VEHICLE** unit; it must be **visible** to the bearer, and it has to take a [Leadership test](vsdata:core-rule/leadership-rolls). Attacks by its models get -1 to [Hit](vsdata:core-rule/hit-rolls), and also -1 to [Wound](vsdata:core-rule/wound-rolls) if it failed that test, for the rest of the phase.",
